:J X‹_2d_chk›5177440\store0 5177448\store5177440\fetch\fetch0\eq[{5177440\fetch5177448\fetch‹_2d_ix›‹_1c_put›5177448\fetch1\radd5177448\store5177448\fetch5177440\fetch\fetch\rlt1\radd}]Y;
# Z zip(l1 l2 fn)->list : elementwise fn over two lists, truncating to the
