#   5180712 c5 ‹ints›: write pointer · ‹words›: k · ‹readbytes›: bytes held
#   5180720 c6 ‹ints›: end of the result block · ‹readbytes›: usable bytes ·
#              ‹words›: the new word
#   5180728 c7 ‹ints› mode: 0 between words · 1 digits · 2 the rest of a
